   "install": {
    "title": "Installation",
    "html": "<p>We recommend installing 🤗 Diffusers in a virtual environment from PyPI or Conda. For more details about installing <a href=\"https://pytorch.org/get-started/locally/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PyTorch</a>, please refer to their official documentation.</p>\n<h5>PyTorch</h5>\n<p>With <code>pip</code> (official package):</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">pip install --upgrade diffusers[torch]\n</code></pre>\n<p>With <code>conda</code> (maintained by the community):</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\">conda install -c conda-forge diffusers\n</code></pre>\n<h5>Apple Silicon (M1/M2) support</h5>\n<p>Please refer to the <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/diffusers/optimization/mps\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">How to use Stable Diffusion in Apple Silicon</a> guide.</p>",
